  "transcript_segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.8,
      "text": "A.I. imposes super weird constraints on your codebase"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.8,
      "end": 6.9,
      "text": "and most codebases out there in the world"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.9,
      "end": 9.4,
      "text": "probably including yours are not ready"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.4,
      "end": 12.0,
      "text": "your codebase way more than the prompts that you used"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.0,
      "end": 14.2,
      "text": "way more than your agents.md file"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.2,
      "end": 16.8,
      "text": "is the biggest influence on A.I.'s output"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.8,
      "end": 18.2,
      "text": "and if it's designed wrong"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.2,
      "end": 20.4,
      "text": "it can cost you in a bunch of different ways"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.4,
      "end": 23.1,
      "text": "it can mean that the A.I. doesn't receive feedback fast enough"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.1,
      "end": 24.8,
      "text": "so it doesn't know if what it changed"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.8,
      "end": 26.2,
      "text": "actually did what it intended"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.2,
      "end": 28.6,
      "text": "it can find it super hard to make sense of things"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.6,
      "end": 31.3,
      "text": "and find files and work out even how to test things"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.3,
      "end": 33.9,
      "text": "and finally it can lead you into cognitive burnout"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.9,
      "end": 36.9,
      "text": "as you try to hold together A.I. in your codebase"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.9,
      "end": 39.3,
      "text": "and patch it all up and keep everything in your mind"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.3,
      "end": 41.7,
      "text": "and my thesis here is that software quality matters"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.7,
      "end": 43.0,
      "text": "more than ever"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.0,
      "end": 45.6,
      "text": "in other words how easy your codebase is to change"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.6,
      "end": 50.2,
      "text": "makes a huge impact on how A.I. then goes and changes it"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.2,
      "end": 52.4,
      "text": "and the stuff that we've known about software best practices"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.4,
      "end": 55.3,
      "text": "for 20 years still holds more true than ever"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.3,
      "end": 56.9,
      "text": "and if you're interested in getting better at this stuff"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.9,
      "end": 59.2,
      "text": "then check out my newsletter A.I. Hero"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.2,
      "end": 60.6,
      "text": "I teach you all about A.I. Coding"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.6,
      "end": 62.2,
      "text": "but this is not for vibe coders"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.2,
      "end": 65.3,
      "text": "this is for real engineers solving real problems"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.3,
      "end": 66.6,
      "text": "and if that's you and you're not sure"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.6,
      "end": 68.0,
      "text": "how to handle these new tools"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.0,
      "end": 69.0,
      "text": "then you are gonna love it"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.0,
      "end": 72.1,
      "text": "now let's imagine that this here is our codebase"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.1,
      "end": 74.8,
      "text": "each one of these little squares represents a module"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.8,
      "end": 76.9,
      "text": "and this module might export some functionality"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.9,
      "end": 78.0,
      "text": "it might export a function"
    },
    {
      "start": 78.0,
      "end": 79.5,
      "text": "it might export some variables"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.5,
      "end": 80.6,
      "text": "might export a component"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.6,
      "end": 83.0,
      "text": "if it's like a you know a react or a front-end thing"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.0,
      "end": 86.0,
      "text": "I want you to imagine that this is the image of your codebase"
    },
    {
      "start": 86.0,
      "end": 87.5,
      "text": "that you hold in your head"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.5,
      "end": 90.0,
      "text": "now you might inside here have some vague groupings"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.0,
      "end": 91.2,
      "text": "of different functionality"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.2,
      "end": 92.4,
      "text": "for instance here you might have"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.4,
      "end": 94.5,
      "text": "let's say a thumbnail editor feature"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.5,
      "end": 96.4,
      "text": "and all of these different modules contribute to that"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.4,
      "end": 97.6,
      "text": "over here you might have"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.6,
      "end": 99.5,
      "text": "a little video editor feature or something"
    },
    {
      "start": 99.5,
      "end": 102.0,
      "text": "down here is all the code related to authentication"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.0,
      "end": 103.0,
      "text": "up here is a bunch of"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.0,
      "end": 105.8,
      "text": "crud forms for updating stuff maybe in a CMS"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.8,
      "end": 107.6,
      "text": "and over here are a couple of example features"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.6,
      "end": 109.6,
      "text": "that I can't be bothered to think of examples for"
    },
    {
      "start": 109.6,
      "end": 111.1,
      "text": "now this map that I've created here"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.1,
      "end": 112.8,
      "text": "of all of the located modules"
    },
    {
      "start": 112.8,
      "end": 114.4,
      "text": "in this particular codebase"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.4,
      "end": 116.0,
      "text": "they're not actually reflected"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.0,
      "end": 117.3,
      "text": "that much in the file system"
    },
    {
      "start": 117.3,
      "end": 118.8,
      "text": "they're all really jumbled up together"
    },
    {
      "start": 118.8,
      "end": 120.1,
      "text": "if I want to just grab"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.1,
      "end": 122.0,
      "text": "let's say an export from this module"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.0,
      "end": 123.9,
      "text": "and import it down into this module"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.9,
      "end": 125.5,
      "text": "I can, there's nothing stopping me"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.5,
      "end": 126.5,
      "text": "and so what you might end up with"
    },
    {
      "start": 126.5,
      "end": 128.5,
      "text": "is a bunch of kind of disparate relationships"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.5,
      "end": 131.0,
      "text": "between stuff that doesn't actually relate to each other"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.0,
      "end": 132.0,
      "text": "now you as the developer"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.0,
      "end": 133.3,
      "text": "understand the mental map"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.3,
      "end": 134.6,
      "text": "between all of these modules"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.6,
      "end": 135.9,
      "text": "but what the AI sees"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.9,
      "end": 137.6,
      "text": "when it first goes into your codebase"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.6,
      "end": 138.8,
      "text": "is this"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.8,
      "end": 141.1,
      "text": "it doesn't see all of the natural groupings"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.1,
      "end": 142.3,
      "text": "and all the natural relationships"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.3,
      "end": 144.8,
      "text": "what it seesis a bunch of disparate modules"
    },
    {
      "start": 144.8,
      "end": 146.2,
      "text": "that can all import from eachother"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.2,
      "end": 147.0,
      "text": "that's because AI"
    },
    {
      "start": 147.0,
      "end": 148.2,
      "text": "when it jumps into your codebase"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.2,
      "end": 149.6,
      "text": "it has no memory"
    },
    {
      "start": 149.6,
      "end": 151.7,
      "text": "it has not experienced your codebase before"
    },
    {
      "start": 151.7,
      "end": 153.1,
      "text": "it's like the guy from Memento"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.1,
      "end": 154.4,
      "text": "who just steps in and goes"
    },
    {
      "start": 154.4,
      "end": 155.7,
      "text": "okay, I'm here"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.7,
      "end": 156.8,
      "text": "oh, what am I doing"
    },
    {
      "start": 156.8,
      "end": 157.9,
      "text": "so my first assertion here"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.9,
      "end": 159.6,
      "text": "is that you need to make sure"
    },
    {
      "start": 159.6,
      "end": 161.3,
      "text": "that the file system"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.3,
      "end": 163.3,
      "text": "and the design of your codebase"
    },
    {
      "start": 163.3,
      "end": 165.4,
      "text": "matches this internal map"
    },
    {
      "start": 165.4,
      "end": 166.3,
      "text": "that you have of it"
    },
    {
      "start": 166.3,
      "end": 167.0,
      "text": "this is because"
    },
    {
      "start": 167.0,
      "end": 168.3,
      "text": "if you describe something"
    },
    {
      "start": 168.3,
      "end": 170.0,
      "text": "over in the video editor section"
    },
    {
      "start": 170.0,
      "end": 171.7,
      "text": "and you use it via a prompt"
    },
    {
      "start": 171.7,
      "end": 173.0,
      "text": "then you want the AI"
    },
    {
      "start": 173.0,
      "end": 174.6,
      "text": "to be able to find it easily"
    },
    {
      "start": 174.6,
      "end": 176.0,
      "text": "the AI won't go in"
    },
    {
      "start": 176.0,
      "end": 177.6,
      "text": "knowing every single function"
    },
    {
      "start": 177.6,
      "end": 178.8,
      "text": "every single module"
    },
    {
      "start": 178.8,
      "end": 179.8,
      "text": "and what they're supposed to do"
    },
    {
      "start": 179.8,
      "end": 181.2,
      "text": "and how they link to eachother"
    },
    {
      "start": 181.2,
      "end": 182.8,
      "text": "and the best way I have found to do that"
    },
    {
      "start": 182.8,
      "end": 184.7,
      "text": "is with deep modules"
    },
    {
      "start": 184.7,
      "end": 186.0,
      "text": "now deep modules comes from"
    },
    {
      "start": 186.0,
      "end": 186.6,
      "text": "this book here"
    },
    {
      "start": 186.6,
      "end": 188.2,
      "text": "which is a philosophy of software design"
    },
    {
      "start": 188.2,
      "end": 189.4,
      "text": "and the idea is that"
    },
    {
      "start": 189.4,
      "end": 191.1,
      "text": "in order to make your system"
    },
    {
      "start": 191.1,
      "end": 192.0,
      "text": "easily navigable"
    },
    {
      "start": 192.0,
      "end": 193.0,
      "text": "and easy to change"
    },
    {
      "start": 193.0,
      "end": 194.6,
      "text": "and also easy to test"
    },
    {
      "start": 194.6,
      "end": 196.5,
      "text": "is that you have a deep module"
    },
    {
      "start": 196.5,
      "end": 198.2,
      "text": "so lots of implementation"
    },
    {
      "start": 198.2,
      "end": 199.9,
      "text": "control by a simple interface"
    },
    {
      "start": 199.9,
      "end": 201.6,
      "text": "what that looks like in terms of our graph"
    },
    {
      "start": 201.6,
      "end": 203.3,
      "text": "is instead of many many"
    },
    {
      "start": 203.3,
      "end": 204.6,
      "text": "small modules"
    },
    {
      "start": 204.6,
      "end": 205.6,
      "text": "you end up with these"
    },
    {
      "start": 205.6,
      "end": 207.3,
      "text": "big chunks of modules"
    },
    {
      "start": 207.3,
      "end": 209.6,
      "text": "with simple controllable interfaces"
    },
    {
      "start": 209.6,
      "end": 211.1,
      "text": "and this means that any exports"
    },
    {
      "start": 211.1,
      "end": 212.1,
      "text": "from these modules"
    },
    {
      "start": 212.1,
      "end": 214.0,
      "text": "have to come from that interface"
    },
    {
      "start": 214.0,
      "end": 215.6,
      "text": "now when I read that about deep modules"
    },
    {
      "start": 215.6,
      "end": 217.0,
      "text": "I immediately thought"
    },
    {
      "start": 217.0,
      "end": 218.7,
      "text": "about putting AI"
    },
    {
      "start": 218.7,
      "end": 220.6,
      "text": "in control of these modules"
    },
    {
      "start": 220.6,
      "end": 221.7,
      "text": "because this is an opportunity"
    },
    {
      "start": 221.7,
      "end": 223.3,
      "text": "to introduce a kind of seam"
    },
    {
      "start": 223.3,
      "end": 224.3,
      "text": "into the codebase"
    },
    {
      "start": 224.3,
      "end": 225.4,
      "text": "I don't really care about"
    },
    {
      "start": 225.4,
      "end": 227.5,
      "text": "what's happening inside here"
    },
    {
      "start": 227.5,
      "end": 228.8,
      "text": "which is the implementation"
    },
    {
      "start": 228.8,
      "end": 229.7,
      "text": "I just care about"
    },
    {
      "start": 229.7,
      "end": 231.4,
      "text": "what's happening in the interface"
    },
    {
      "start": 231.4,
      "end": 232.5,
      "text": "because the interface"
    },
    {
      "start": 232.5,
      "end": 234.3,
      "text": "which is the publicly accessible"
    },
    {
      "start": 234.3,
      "end": 236.1,
      "text": "API of this module"
    },
    {
      "start": 236.1,
      "end": 237.6,
      "text": "I can carefully control"
    },
    {
      "start": 237.6,
      "end": 240.1,
      "text": "and I can apply my taste to and design"
    },
    {
      "start": 240.1,
      "end": 242.1,
      "text": "and then the stuff inside here"
    },
    {
      "start": 242.1,
      "end": 243.1,
      "text": "I can just delegate"
    },
    {
      "start": 243.1,
      "end": 244.8,
      "text": "to an AI to control"
    },
    {
      "start": 244.8,
      "end": 246.2,
      "text": "and I can write tests"
    },
    {
      "start": 246.2,
      "end": 248.1,
      "text": "that completely lock down"
    },
    {
      "start": 248.1,
      "end": 249.5,
      "text": "the module in terms of its behavior"
    },
    {
      "start": 249.5,
      "end": 251.1,
      "text": "so these are not just deep modules"
    },
    {
      "start": 251.1,
      "end": 252.2,
      "text": "with simple interfaces"
    },
    {
      "start": 252.2,
      "end": 254.5,
      "text": "they're also gray box modules"
    },
    {
      "start": 254.5,
      "end": 255.1,
      "text": "in other words"
    },
    {
      "start": 255.1,
      "end": 256.5,
      "text": "I don't actually need"
    },
    {
      "start": 256.5,
      "end": 258.9,
      "text": "to look inside these modules"
    },
    {
      "start": 258.9,
      "end": 259.8,
      "text": "I can if I want to"
    },
    {
      "start": 259.8,
      "end": 260.8,
      "text": "if I want to influence"
    },
    {
      "start": 260.8,
      "end": 261.4,
      "text": "their outcome"
    },
    {
      "start": 261.4,
      "end": 262.3,
      "text": "or if I need to apply"
    },
    {
      "start": 262.3,
      "end": 264.0,
      "text": "some taste to the implementation"
    },
    {
      "start": 264.0,
      "end": 264.8,
      "text": "or I need to improve"
    },
    {
      "start": 264.8,
      "end": 266.2,
      "text": "their performance or something"
    },
    {
      "start": 266.2,
      "end": 267.3,
      "text": "but as long as the tests"
    },
    {
      "start": 267.3,
      "end": 267.9,
      "text": "are good"
    },
    {
      "start": 267.9,
      "end": 269.1,
      "text": "then I don't really need to care"
    },
    {
      "start": 269.1,
      "end": 270.3,
      "text": "about what happens inside"
    },
    {
      "start": 270.3,
      "end": 271.6,
      "text": "now this has three"
    },
    {
      "start": 271.6,
      "end": 272.8,
      "text": "massive benefits"
    },
    {
      "start": 272.8,
      "end": 273.7,
      "text": "the first one is that"
    },
    {
      "start": 273.7,
      "end": 275.1,
      "text": "I can make my codebase"
    },
    {
      "start": 275.1,
      "end": 276.5,
      "text": "way more navigable"
    },
    {
      "start": 276.5,
      "end": 277.5,
      "text": "let's for the sake of argument"
    },
    {
      "start": 277.5,
      "end": 279.0,
      "text": "just call each of these services"
    },
    {
      "start": 279.0,
      "end": 279.2,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "start": 279.2,
      "end": 280.4,
      "text": "the video editor service"
    },
    {
      "start": 280.4,
      "end": 281.6,
      "text": "the thumbnail service"
    },
    {
      "start": 281.6,
      "end": 281.9,
      "text": "whatever"
    },
    {
      "start": 281.9,
      "end": 282.8,
      "text": "if I document these"
    },
    {
      "start": 282.8,
      "end": 284.5,
      "text": "each inside their own folder"
    },
    {
